  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Dwivesh Mishra vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 17 October, 2024 Author: Maninder S. Bhatti Bench: Maninder S. Bhatti Neutral Citation No. 2024:Mphc-Jbp:51942 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Jabalpur Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Maninder S. Bhatti On The 17 th Of October, 2024 Misc. Criminal Case No. 41460 of 2024 Dwivesh Mishra Versus The State Of Madhya Pradesh Appearance: Shri D.S. Dubey - Advocate for the applicant.",
    "facts": "This is repeat (second) bail application filed by the applicant under Section 483 of Bhartiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 for grant of regular bail relating to Crime No.137/2024 dated 19.07.2024 registered at Police Station Janeh, District Rewa or the offences punishable under Sections 8, 21, 22 of NDPS Act and Section 5/13 of M.P. Drug Control Act. 2. Earlier bail application of the present applicant was dismissed as withdrawn vide order dated 09.09.2024 in M.Cr.C.No.36961/2024.",
    "arguments": "It is contended by the counsel that the applicant had purchased 5850 bottles of Wincerex Syrup which is manufactured by Wings Pharmaceuticals Private Limited Delhi and then the entire bottles were intended to sold to retailers."
  },
